  "summary": "Preinstall DNS exfiltration of host reconnaissance to snurkeburk.com",
  "details": "The package's preinstall lifecycle script runs index.js, which invokes child_process.exec to collect installer host identifiers (hostname, current working directory, current user, and public IP retrieved via curl to ifconfig.me), hex-encodes the concatenated output, and exfiltrates it to attacker-controlled DNS by issuing nslookup queries against subdomains of snurkeburk.com. This fires automatically on npm install.",
